OL,3,AMan charged after fire in which woman
OL,4,Aand girl died
OL,5,
OL,6,FA 23-year-old man has been charged with
OL,7,Fmurder following a fatal house fire.
OL,9,FNatalie McDonald, 34, died in the blaze
OL,10,Fin Grangetown, near Middlesbrough, in
OL,11,Fthe early hours of Wednesday, along
OL,12,Fwith her niece Valentina Foster, seven.
OL,14,FThe man was charged with two counts of
OL,15,Fmurder, two counts of grievous bodily
OL,16,Fharm with intent and two counts of
OL,17,Fattempted grievous bodily harm with
OL,18,Fintent, Cleveland Police say. He is
OL,19,Fscheduled to appear at Teesside
OL,20,FMagistrates' Court later on Tuesday.
OL,23,APub: 01-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG3/39
