OL,3,ABurnham to face Parliament as prime
OL,4,Aminister for first time
OL,5,
OL,6,FAndy Burnham is set to speak in the
OL,7,FCommons later, addressing MPs on their
OL,8,Ffirst day back at work after the summer
OL,9,Frecess, in what will be a highly
OL,10,Fcharged moment.
OL,12,FSix weeks after he walked up Downing
OL,13,FStreet, and 16 years after he last
OL,14,Fappeared at the dispatch box as part of
OL,15,Fa Labour government, he will stand
OL,16,Fbefore MPs for the first time as prime
OL,17,Fminister.
OL,19,FIn the close confines of the chamber,
OL,20,Fwith ranks of Labour members behind
OL,21,Fhim, Burnham will finally come face to
OL,22,Fface with his political opponents.
OL,23,APub: 01-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG5/39
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
