OL,3,ABurnham to face Parliament as prime
OL,4,Aminister for first time
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe pressure of the occasion, the
OL,7,Fscrutiny he will face, the deftness
OL,8,Fwith which he handles questions, the
OL,9,Fattacks, the barbs, the asides, will
OL,10,Fall be key to how the public perceive
OL,11,Fhim.
OL,23,APub: 01-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG6/39
